 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.5.3-rc12 — Group activity (audit log) + clearer invites
+
+Layout:
+- New **Invites** tab with two clearly separate, color-coded sections: **Group invites** (green — ask people in your group instance to join the VRChat group) and **Instance invites** (blue — bring friends to where you are).
+- Command now shows both side by side with equal weight: status, what's blocking it, an on/off switch and a one-click send for each.
+- Approving groups for recruiting is now a list of your groups by name (no more pasting grp_ IDs; that's still available under “Add a group by ID”). The plain-language status says exactly why group invites can't run (not in a group instance / group not approved).
+- **Group invites in your own instances**: turn on “Your own instances” and pick a group (e.g. The UnderWeb). Automatic and one-click group invites then also run in instances you opened (Friends+, Invite+, etc.), not just approved group instances. Never in public instances or other people's. Members are still checked first and skipped.
+- **Message with instance invites**: pick one of your 12 saved VRChat invite messages, or write a new one (saved into an empty slot first, otherwise the oldest one off cooldown — VRChat lets each change once an hour). Used for both “Invite now” and automatic invites, and shown on the Command tile.
+- Removed the avatar parameter test, and heart rate no longer sends avatar parameters (it still shows in the chatbox).
+
+New in Groups → pick a group → **Group activity**:
+- Shows VRChat's official group audit log, read with your own VRChat login (the session UWX already uses). Nothing goes through an UnderWeb server.
+- Only appears for groups where your role has VRChat's “View audit log” permission; VRChat enforces it.
+- Exact times (to the second, with the original UTC timestamp), who did it, who or what it targeted, and before → after details for edits (role names resolved, permission lists shown as added/removed).
+- Filters: type (bans & removals, joins/leaves/invites, roles, instances, posts, group settings), time range, staff member, and text search (names, usr_ IDs, descriptions).
+- Last-24-hour summary and the most active staff.
+- Auto-checks every 2 minutes while open and right after you ban/remove from UWX. Pages gently (one request at a time) and stops on VRChat rate limits.
+- Every entry is archived in UWX's local database on this PC, so history keeps building up beyond what VRChat returns. “Load older” walks further back.
+- Export the filtered view as CSV or JSON; copy any single entry.
+
 ## 0.5.2-rc11 — OSC Lab 3: music, weather and statuses together
 
 Root causes fixed from 0.5.0:
